# ============================================================
#  Creamy Bite – includes/ is server-side only
#
#  Nothing in this folder is ever a URL. Every file here is reached
#  through require/include from a page, which is a filesystem read and
#  is NOT affected by these rules. Blocking HTTP access means a stray
#  request for /includes/secrets.php or /includes/db.php can never
#  return source or trigger a side effect.
# ============================================================
Require all denied
